71146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3s3gkm_22GsQ7kNvwFSM1HQ&_nc_oc=AdoQP__1SvC7r3lrKemxcbkAkk7aOtLYFtxeOvk3vI7AAxTGawQ5_WSxpVQAcwHopTI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBPijcflDFGBMk5hWs7vH2tRsKcxpS3fb6GoIXWUsdoSA&oe=6A58D839"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Zt5a7ylx_KEQ7kNvwFWmURV&_nc_oc=AdqNfWf639B_rboMWwlO0drnBOnU7gWkU0X3s7phuGPiOCzuGCXhhKSJM9jvDQ3emwY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBySpR3bSCpKLRWbbP-0RWoumeaYUaqM4eOwjZFKPW52g&oe=6A58EB13"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=r3_O5Q5vJAAQ7kNvwGoh4Ps&_nc_oc=AdrrK3kZMN9ivwgf0XQZxqMN4ltgMhklBZ89ghGwcdlNYwlPcon8MPTk0d7qwl-olt0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCw3y-n-O9ZZbXyRAHltqPegL8yGK6_j-2-2vBOn6hgPg&oe=6A58E95A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https: